<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>Install ePTT</title>
<style>
  :root { color-scheme: light dark; --accent: #f28c28; }
  body { font: 17px/1.5 -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 34rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem; }
  h1 { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
  .version { color: GrayText; margin-top: 0; }
  a.install { display: inline-block; margin: 1.5rem 0; padding: .9rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 999px;
              background: var(--accent); color: white; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  li { margin-bottom: .5rem; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>ePTT</h1>
<p class="version">Version @VERSION@</p>
<p>Serverless, end-to-end encrypted push-to-talk for iPhone and Apple Watch.</p>
<a class="install" href="itms-services://?action=download-manifest&amp;url=@BASE@/manifest.plist">Install on this iPhone</a>
<ol>
  <li>Open this page in <strong>Safari</strong> on your iPhone.</li>
  <li>Your device must be registered with the developer's account first; otherwise installation fails with "Unable to install".</li>
  <li>After installing, turn on <strong>Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Developer Mode</strong> if iOS asks.</li>
  <li>The watch app installs automatically if <em>Automatic App Install</em> is on in the Watch app.</li>
  <li>Get the group's push key from a friend (Settings → Push key) so your phone can be woken.</li>
</ol>
</body>
</html>
